#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &k3b; &DCOP; Interface"
msgstr "ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់​​ K3b DCOP "

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&k3b; features, like many other &kde; applications as well, a &DCOP; interface "
"which makes it possible to control a part of it's functionality from &eg; a "
"shellscript."
msgstr "លក្ខណៈពិសេស​របស់​ K3b ក៏​ដូច​កម្មវិធី​ផ្សេងទៀត​របស់​ Kde ដែរ​ ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់​"
" DCOP ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​វា​\n"
"ត្រួតពិនិត្យ​ផ្នែក​នៃ​មុខងារ​របស់វា​​ពី សែល​ស្គ្រីប ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use these &DCOP; functions you can either use the <command>dcop</command> "
"commandline program or the more convenient <application>Kdcop</application> "
"application. Both provide the same functionality so it's mostly a matter of "
"taste and context of usage when deciding which way to choose."
msgstr "ដើម្បីប្រើ​មុខងារ​ DCOP "
"ទាំងនេះ​អ្នក​ក៏​អាច​ប្រើ​កម្មវិធី​បន្ទាត់​​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​ "
"<command>dcop</command> ឬ​កម្មវិធី​ "
"<application>Kdcop</application>"
""
" ដែលមាន​ភាព​​ងាយស្រួល​ជាច្រើនក៏​បាន​​។​ វា​ទាំងពីរ​នេះផ្តល់\n"
"នូវ​មុខងារ​ដូចៗគ្នា​ ដូច្នេះ​វាបញ្ហា​ច្រើនទេ​ "
"ហើយ​បរិបទ​នៃ​ការប្រើ​ពេល​វិនិច្ឆ័យ​ថា​ជ្រើស​វិធី​មួយណា ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter assumes that you're using the <command>dcop</command> "
"commandline program. To access &k3b;'s &DCOP; functions, make sure that &k3b; "
"is started and then enter something like this at a console:"
msgstr "ជំពូក​នេះ​សម្មត​ថា​អ្នកកំពុ​ងប្រើ​កម្មវិធី​បន្ទាត់​ពាក្យបញ្ជា "
"<command>dcop</command> ។ ដើម្បី​ចូល​ដំណើរការ​​មុខងារ​ DCOP របស់ ​K3b "
""
"ឲ្យ​ប្រាកដ​ថា​ K3b "
"បាន​ចាប់​ផ្តើម​​ហើយ​បន្ទាប់​មកបញ្ចូល​អ្វី​ក៏​បាន​នៅ​ក្នុងកុងសូល​ ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: dcop.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>#</prompt> <command>dcop</command> <option>k3b</option> <option>"
"K3bInterface</option> <replaceable>[function]</replaceable>"
msgstr "<prompt>#</prompt> <command>dcop</command> <option>k3b</option> "
"<option>K3bInterface</option> <replaceable>[function]</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Besides the generic &DCOP; functions available to all &kde; applications, "
"&k3b;'s DCOP interface mainly consists of two parts as described below."
msgstr "ក្រៅពី​ប្រភេទ​នៃ​មុខងារ​ DCOP ដែលអាច​រក​បាន​​គ្រប់​កម្មវិធី​ KDE ទាំងអស់​ "
""
"ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់DCOP របស់​ K3b DCOP "
"ច្រើនតែ​មាន​ពី​រផ្នែក​ដែលបាន​ពិពណ៌នា​ដូចខាងក្រោម​នេះ ។​"

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "The default K3bInterface"
msgstr "លំនាំដើម​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់ K3b "

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The default K3b DCOP interface provides functionality like copyCD, formatDVD, "
"and methods for creating new projects."
msgstr "លំនាំដើម​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់​ K3b DCOP ផ្តល់នូវ​មុខងារ​ដូច​ជា​ចម្លង​ស៊ីឌី "
"ធ្វើទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ឌីវីឌី "
"និង​វិធីសាស្ត្រ​មួយ​ចំនួន​ទៀត​សម្រាប់បង្កើត​គម្រោង​ថ្មី​ ។​"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: dcop.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"DCOPRef createDataCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createAudioCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createMixedCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createVideoCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createMovixCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createDataDVDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createVideoDVDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createMovixDVDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef openProject(KURL url)\n"
"QValueList&lt;DCOPRef&gt; projects()\n"
"DCOPRef currentProject()\n"
"void copyCd()\n"
"void copyDvd()\n"
"void eraseCdrw()\n"
"void formatDvd()\n"
"void burnCdImage(KURL url)\n"
"void burnDvdImage(KURL url)"
msgstr "DCOPRef createDataCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createAudioCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createMixedCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createVideoCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createMovixCDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createDataDVDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createVideoDVDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef createMovixDVDProject()\n"
"DCOPRef openProject(KURL url)\n"
"QValueList&lt;DCOPRef&gt; projects()\n"
"DCOPRef currentProject()\n"
"void copyCd()\n"
"void copyDvd()\n"
"void eraseCdrw()\n"
"void formatDvd()\n"
"void burnCdImage(KURL url)\n"
"void burnDvdImage(KURL url)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As result from one of the createXXXProject methods one gets a DCOP reference to "
"the newly created project: "
"<programlisting>DCOPRef(k3b,K3bProject-0)</programlisting> "
"Alternatively you may create a project using the command line: <screen>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <command>k3b</command> <replaceable>--audiocd</replaceable>\n"
"</screen> and then retrieve a reference to this project with <screen>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <command>dcop</command> <option>k3b</option> <option>"
"K3bInterface</option> <replaceable>currentProject</replaceable>\n"
"</screen> Using this reference it is possible to manipulate the project using "
"the <link linkend=\"k3bprojectinterface\">K3bProjectInterface</link>."
msgstr "ជា​លទ្ធផល​មួយ​បាន​មក​ពី​ការបង្កើត​គម្រោង​ XXX "
"វិធីសាស្ត្រ​មួយ​ទទួល​បាន​សេចក្តីយោ​ង​ DCOP ​ដើម្បី​\n"
"បង្កើត​គម្រោង​ថ្មីមួយ ៖  "
"<programlisting>DCOPRef(k3b,K3bProject-0)</programlisting> \n"
"អ្នកក៏​អាច​បង្កើត​គម្រោង​ដោយ​ប្រើ​បន្ទាត់ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា ៖ <screen>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <command>k3b</command> "
"<replaceable>--audiocd</replaceable>\n"
"</screen> ហើយ​បន្ទាប់មកទៅយក​សេចក្តីយោង​គម្រោង​នេះជាមួយ​ "
"<screen>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <command>dcop</command> <option>k3b</option> "
"<option>K3bInterface</option> <replaceable>គម្រោង​បច្ចុប្បន្ន​</replaceable>\n"
""
"</screen> ប្រើ​សេចក្តីយោង​នេះវា​ប្រហែល​ជា​អាច​រៀបចំ​គម្រោង​ប្រើ​ <link "
"linkend=\"k3bprojectinterface\">K3bProjectInterface</link> ។​"

#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "K3bProjectInterface"
msgstr "K3bProjectInterface"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: dcop.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"void addUrls(KURL::List urls)\n"
"void addUrl(KURL url)\n"
"void burn()"
msgstr "void addUrls(KURL::List urls)\n"
"void addUrl(KURL url)\n"
"void burn()"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"K3b offers the K3bProjectInterface as listed above or the more powerful "
"K3bDataProjectInterface which only applies to data projects (CD and DVD):"
msgstr "K3b ស្នើឲ្យ​ K3bProjectInterface រាយបញ្ជី​ខាងលើ​ ឬ​ K3bDataProjectInterface "
"ដែល​មានអនុភាព​ខ្ពស់​\n"
"អាច​បាន​តែអនុវត្ត​​សម្រាប់​គម្រោង​ទិន្នន័យ (ស៊ីឌី​ និង​ឌីវីឌី) ៖"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: dcop.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"void createFolder(QString name)\n"
"void createFolder(QString name,QString parent)\n"
"void addUrl(KURL url,QString parent)\n"
"void addUrls(KURL::List urls,QString parent)\n"
"void removeItem(QString path)\n"
"void renameItem(QString path,QString newName)\n"
"void setVolumeID(QString id)"
msgstr "void createFolder(QString name)\n"
"void createFolder(QString name,QString parent)\n"
"void addUrl(KURL url,QString parent)\n"
"void addUrls(KURL::List urls,QString parent)\n"
"void removeItem(QString path)\n"
"void renameItem(QString path,QString newName)\n"
"void setVolumeID(QString id)"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using this it is possible to fill a data project with files and folders from a "
"script. The following script for example creates a new data project, adds "
"several folders to the project, and adds files to the newly created folders:"
msgstr "ប្រើ​វា​អាច​ទៅ​បំពេញ​គម្រោង​ទិន្នន័យ​​ជាមួយ​​ឯកសារ និង​ថត​បាន​មក​ពី​ស្គ្រីប​"
" ។ \n"
"ស្គ្រីប​ដូចខាងក្រោម​នេះ​ សម្រាប់​ឧទាហរណ៍​បង្កើត​គម្រោង​ទិន្នន័យ​ថ្មី​ "
"បន្ថែម​ថត​មួយ​ចំនួន​ទៅ​កាន់គម្រោង "
"ហើយ​បន្ថែម​ឯកសារ​ជាច្រើន​ទៅ​កាន់​ថត​ដែល​បាន​បង្កើ​តរួច ៖"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: dcop.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"PROJECT=$(dcop k3b K3bInterface createDataCDProject)\n"
"dcop $PROJECT createFolder test\n"
"dcop $PROJECT createFolder foo\n"
"dcop $PROJECT createFolder bar /foo\n"
"dcop $PROJECT addUrl /home/trueg/somefile.txt /foo/bar"
msgstr "#!/bin/bash\n"
"PROJECT=$(dcop k3b K3bInterface createDataCDProject)\n"
"dcop $PROJECT createFolder test\n"
"dcop $PROJECT createFolder foo\n"
"dcop $PROJECT createFolder bar /foo\n"
"dcop $PROJECT addUrl /home/trueg/somefile.txt /foo/bar"
